function feedActionsHTML(p,owner){var emojis=['👍','❤️','😂','😮','😢','🔥'],mine=p.myReaction||'';return '<div class="feed-actions"><div class="feed-reaction-line"><div class="feed-reaction-wrap"><button type="button" class="feed-react-trigger'+(mine?' is-reacted':'')+'" data-feed-react-toggle="'+esc(p.id)+'" aria-expanded="false">'+(mine||'👍')+' <span>'+(mine?'Reacted':'Like')+'</span></button><div class="feed-reaction-picker" data-feed-react-picker="'+esc(p.id)+'">'+emojis.map(function(e){return '<button type="button" data-feed-react="'+esc(p.id)+'" data-emoji="'+e+'" aria-label="React '+e+'"'+(mine===e?' aria-pressed="true"':'')+'>'+e+'</button>'}).join('')+'</div></div><span class="feed-reaction-count">'+Number(p.reactions||0)+' reactions</span></div><div class="feed-action-row"><button type="button" data-feed-comments="'+esc(p.id)+'">Comment · '+Number(p.comments||0)+'</button><button type="button" data-feed-reshare="'+esc(p.id)+'">↗ Reshare · '+Number(p.reshares||0)+'</button>'+(owner?'<button type="button" data-feed-pin="'+esc(p.id)+'" data-pinned="'+(p.pinned?'1':'0')+'">'+(p.pinned?'Unpin':'Pin post')+'</button>':'')+'<button type="button" data-feed-report="'+esc(p.id)+'">Report</button></div></div>'}
function openFeedComments(pid){if(!CONNECTED){toast('Sign in to comment.');return}api('GET','/feed/posts/'+encodeURIComponent(pid)+'/comments').then(function(d){var rows=(d.comments||[]).map(function(c){return '<div class="feed-comment"><b>'+esc(c.author_name||'Member')+'</b><p>'+esc(c.body)+'</p><small>'+esc(fmtT(c.created_at))+'</small></div>'}).join('');tlSheet('feedComments','<h3 style="font-size:19px;margin:0 0 12px">Comments</h3><div class="feed-comment-list">'+(rows||'<p class="feed-comment-empty">No comments yet. Start the conversation.</p>')+'</div><div class="feed-comment-compose"><textarea id="feedCommentBody" maxlength="2000" rows="2" placeholder="Write a thoughtful comment…"></textarea><button type="button" data-feed-comment-send="'+esc(pid)+'">Send</button></div>')}).catch(fail)}
function feed(){
 loadFeed(false);var types=['All','Posts','Feedback','Announcements'],rows=st.feedPosts||[];
 var shown=rows.filter(function(p){return st.feedType==='All'||p.type===st.feedType});
 var html=TMENV.app?'<div class="top"><div style="flex:1"><h2 style="font-size:24px">Feed</h2><small style="color:var(--mut)">Community posts, feedback and announcements</small></div></div>':'';
 html+='<div class="sub">'+types.map(function(t){return '<button class="'+(st.feedType===t?'on':'')+'" data-feed-type="'+t+'">'+t+'</button>'}).join('')+'</div>';
  if(st.feedLoading&&!rows.length)html+='<div class="empty">Loading community posts…</div>';
 else if(st.feedError&&!rows.length)html+='<div class="empty"><b>Feed unavailable</b>'+esc(st.feedError)+'<button class="btn sm" data-act="feed-refresh">Try again</button></div>';
 else if(st.feedError)html+='<div class="fine" role="status">'+esc(st.feedError)+' <button class="btn sm" data-act="feed-refresh">Retry</button></div>';
 if(!shown.length&&!st.feedLoading&&!st.feedError)html+='<div class="empty"><b>No posts yet</b>Be the first to share an update or feedback.</div>';
 else if(shown.length)html+=shown.map(function(p){var _an=String(p.author||'TradeMate member'),_ai=_an.trim().charAt(0).toUpperCase()||'T';return '<article class="card feed-post" style="margin:10px 16px"><div class="fp-head"><span class="fp-av" aria-hidden="true" style="background:'+AVC[_ai.charCodeAt(0)%AVC.length]+'">'+esc(_ai)+'</span><div class="fp-who"><button type="button" class="tl-au" data-tl-user="'+esc(p.author||'')+'" data-tl-user-id="'+esc(p.author_user_id||'')+'" style="display:block;font-weight:800">'+esc(_an)+'</button><small>'+esc(p.type)+' · '+esc(p.time)+'</small></div></div>'+(p.title?'<h3>'+esc(p.title)+'</h3>':'')+tlBodyHTML(p.body)+(p.attachments||[]).map(function(a){var url=TMCFG.api+'/feed/posts/'+encodeURIComponent(p.id)+'/attachments/'+encodeURIComponent(a.id),mime=String(a.content_type||"").toLowerCase();if(mime.indexOf("audio/")===0)return '<div class="sub"><audio controls preload="none" src="'+esc(url)+'"></audio><small>'+esc(a.file_name)+'</small></div>';if(mime.indexOf("image/")===0)return '<p class="fp-media"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="'+esc(url)+'"><img class="fp-img" src="'+esc(url)+'" alt="'+esc(a.file_name)+'" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="display:block;max-width:100%;max-height:320px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:10px"></a></p>';return '<p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="'+esc(url)+'">'+esc(a.file_name)+'</a></p>'}).join('')+feedActionsHTML(p,!!(st.me.id&&p.author_user_id===st.me.id))+'</article>'}).join('');
 return html+tlFab()+'<p class="fine">Posts and comments are shared through TradeMate accounts. Announcements are published by moderators.</p>';
}

